Tannin
Free Steam Play for Mac.

Tannin is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (see LICENSE).

Tannin builds on the work of others. It downloads the following at install time,
checks each against a pinned SHA-256, and redistributes none of it:

- NotProton (https://github.com/NotProtonNot/NotProton), GPL-3.0.
  The Steam add-on, the Steam bridge (a port of Valve's Proton lsteamclient, which is
  under the Steamworks SDK license, and steam-helper, BSD-3-Clause), signatures and helpers.
  Files under Tools/ntdll-patch/ are taken from NotProton and remain under its license.

- winecx-gptk (https://github.com/frankea/winecx-gptk, from https://github.com/dappermint/winecx-gptk).
  A build of Wine from CodeWeavers' published CrossOver sources. Wine is LGPL-2.1-or-later.

- Steam client files, from Valve's own download servers. Copyright Valve Corporation.

Tannin never includes Apple's Game Porting Toolkit or D3DMetal. You download the toolkit
from Apple yourself and Tannin imports it after checking Apple's code signature.

Reference material that shaped the design, with thanks:
- Bridgeplay (https://github.com/raymondchins/Bridgeplay), GPL-3.0, for its engine documentation.
- Unwine (https://github.com/chansekhung/unwine), GPL-3.0.
- Kaon (https://github.com/natbro/kaon), Apache-2.0.

